  {
   "id": "actuators",
   "title": "Actuators",
   "tier": "core",
   "blurb": "Twenty-two RobStride actuators by BHL's own classes, one step up at the knee: RS02 (17 N\u00b7m) where BHL has a 5010, RS06 (36 N\u00b7m) where it has a 6512 at the shoulder pitch, RS03 (60 N\u00b7m) in the new hip stack and in the knee cradle, which is bored out for it (the 6512 class could not hold the crouch at adult size). BHL's 6512 costs $189 and its 5010 $136 in parts, each with a week of printing and assembly; the RobStrides cost more and arrive assembled.",
